Independent Windows source metadata adapter

Copyright (c) 2026 REA Archive contributors

source-metadata.mjs and source-metadata.test.mjs are independent new code,
licensed under the MIT License below. The metadata adapter is based on the
standard Node child-process API, Windows PowerShell and .NET filesystem APIs;
it contains no original 7-Zip source. Its use does not change the notices or
licenses applying to existing Archive code or the source-assisted 7Z/AES/LZMA
implementation. Retain all existing source and LGPL notices when composing
this derivative with the frozen AES candidate.

